<body><main>
<nav class="mast"><a href="index.php">Chloe Reads Jon</a><span>No noise. Just new leaves.</span></nav>
<header><div><div class="eyebrow">A small experiment in RSS</div><h1>Signal<br><em>Orchard.</em></h1></div><p>Different branches. One reading basket. Gather the genuinely new stories, and learn why a familiar headline can be a very sneaky fruit.</p></header>
<div class="orchard" id="orchard"><img src="?art=1" alt="An illustrated orange grove whose copper branches deliver glowing signals into a paper reading tray."><div class="fruitcount"><b id="count">0</b> stories in your basket</div></div>
<div class="deck">
<section><div class="eyebrow">01 / Choose your branches</div><h2>What shall we follow?</h2><p class="small">These are fictional feeds, not live news. Subscribe to one or more, then inspect two harvests. The second includes a few identity tricks.</p>
<label class="branch"><input type="checkbox" value="chapel" checked><div>The Chapel Window<span>Faith, art &amp; ordinary goodness</span></div></label>
<label class="branch"><input type="checkbox" value="workshop" checked><div>The Curious Workshop<span>Small inventions &amp; satisfying explanations</span></div></label>
<label class="branch"><input type="checkbox" value="wild" checked><div>The Wild Notebook<span>Nature doing something peculiar</span></div></label>
<button class="primary" id="start">Gather signals →</button><p id="setupnote" class="small" aria-live="polite">No accounts, no timer, no score.</p>
</section>
<section class="paper" aria-label="Story inspection">
<div id="welcome"><div class="eyebrow">02 / The reading basket</div><h2>Nothing has fallen.<br>Yet.</h2><p>Your feed reader remembers an item's identifier, not just its headline.</p><p class="small">Keep a first-time arrival. Leave a repeat on the branch. Watch out: two separate stories can share a title!</p></div>
<div id="game" hidden><div class="eyebrow" id="edition"></div><div class="progress" aria-hidden="true"><div id="bar"></div></div><h2 id="headline"></h2><p id="summary"></p><dl class="identity"><dt>Feed</dt><dd id="feed"></dd><dt>Item ID</dt><dd id="guid"></dd></dl><div class="actions" id="choices"><button id="keep">Keep: new item</button><button id="repeat">Leave: seen before</button></div><div id="feedback" class="feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><button id="next" hidden>Next signal →</button></div>
<div id="finish" hidden><div class="eyebrow">Harvest complete</div><h2 id="finishTitle"></h2><p>Many sources, one quiet place to read. No endless tab pilgrimage required.</p><p class="small">A changed headline does not necessarily mean a new item. A matching headline does not necessarily mean a repeat. Identity is the useful clue.</p><button id="again">Plant another orchard</button></div>
</section></div>
<section class="ledger"><div class="eyebrow">03 / Your memory of the harvest</div><h2>Already in the basket</h2><p class="small" id="empty">As you keep items, their feed and ID will appear here. Compare incoming signals against these.</p><ul id="basket"></ul></section>
<div class="lesson"><p><strong>The little idea behind the orchard:</strong> RSS lets a reader collect updates from sites you choose. Jon liked New Advent because it curated Catholic writing from across the web. Curation chooses what matters; a feed reader helps deliver it.</p><details><summary>What does this simplify?</summary><p class="small">In this toy, identity is a pair: feed + item ID. Real RSS commonly uses a GUID; Atom uses an entry ID. Readers may also use links or other rules when identifiers are absent, and handle updates differently. This game treats an updated item as already seen, not as a brand-new story. It does not fetch, subscribe to, or store any real feeds.</p></details></div>
<footer>Inspired by Jon’s <a href="?source=1">Best Catholic RSS Feed: New Advent</a>.<br>A tiny, quiet internet for curious people.</footer>
<noscript><p>This orchard needs JavaScript to gather its signals.</p></noscript>
</main>
<script>
'use strict';
const names={chapel:'The Chapel Window',workshop:'The Curious Workshop',wild:'The Wild Notebook'};
const items=[
{f:'chapel',id:'c-101',t:'A window made of morning',s:'A small chapel discovers how stained glass changes the light.'},
{f:'workshop',id:'w-201',t:'The bell that rings without a battery',s:'A bicycle bell gets its voice from a spring and a little metal dome.'},
{f:'wild',id:'n-301',t:'The secret life of a leaf',s:'A maple leaf turns sunlight into the energy a tree needs.'},
{f:'chapel',id:'c-102',t:'A very small act of courage',s:'Someone invites a lonely neighbour to lunch.'},
{f:'workshop',id:'w-202',t:'Why soap bubbles are round',s:'Surface tension pulls a bubble toward a shape with very little surface area.'},
{f:'wild',id:'n-302',t:'An otter has a favourite stone',s:'Some sea otters carry a rock to help crack open a meal.'},
{f:'chapel',id:'c-101',t:'Morning light through a chapel window',s:'The editor has improved the title of this earlier story.',why:'Same feed, same ID. The headline changed, but this is still the window story you kept.'},
{f:'workshop',id:'w-201',t:'The bell that rings without a battery',s:'The feed delivered the same item again during its next refresh.',why:'Refreshing a feed often returns older items alongside new ones. This exact ID is already in your basket.'},
{f:'wild',id:'n-303',t:'The secret life of a leaf',s:'This time: a leaf insect disguises itself as part of a tree.',why:'Same headline, different ID! This is a separate story about an insect, not the maple leaf.'},
{f:'chapel',id:'c-103',t:'A window made of morning',s:'A second writer visits a completely different church window.',why:'A reused headline is not enough to declare a duplicate. This feed assigned a new item ID.'},
{f:'workshop',id:'w-203',t:'The secret life of a leaf',s:'An engineer folds a paper leaf into a springy miniature mechanism.',why:'A familiar title, but a different feed and ID. This belongs in the basket.'},
{f:'wild',id:'n-302',t:'An otter has a favourite stone',s:'Updated: the writer adds a detail about how otters keep rocks tucked under an arm.',why:'More information, same item ID. It is an update to an item you already have, not a new item in this toy.'}
];
let queue=[],pos=0,seen=new Map(),answered=false;
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);
function show(){answered=false;const x=queue[pos];$('edition').textContent=(pos<queue.filter(x=>x.first).length?'First harvest':'Second harvest')+' / signal '+(pos+1)+' of '+queue.length;$('headline').textContent=x.t;$('summary').textContent=x.s;$('feed').textContent=names[x.f];$('guid').textContent=x.id;$('feedback').textContent='Compare the feed and item ID with your basket.';$('feedback').className='feedback';$('next').hidden=true;$('choices').hidden=false;$('bar').style.width=(pos/queue.length*100)+'%';}
function start(){const selected=[...document.querySelectorAll('.branch input:checked')].map(x=>x.value);if(!selected.length){$('setupnote').textContent='Choose at least one branch before gathering.';return;}queue=items.map((x,i)=>({...x,first:i<6})).filter(x=>selected.includes(x.f));seen=new Map();pos=0;$('basket').replaceChildren();$('count').textContent='0';$('empty').hidden=false;$('welcome').hidden=true;$('finish').hidden=true;$('game').hidden=false;$('start').disabled=true;document.querySelectorAll('.branch input').forEach(x=>x.disabled=true);$('orchard').dataset.grown='false';$('setupnote').textContent='Your branches are planted. Use the reading basket to inspect each signal.';show();}
function decide(keep){if(answered)return;const x=queue[pos],key=x.f+':'+x.id,isNew=!seen.has(key);if(keep!==isNew){$('feedback').className='feedback bad';$('feedback').textContent=isNew?'Look closely: this feed + ID pair is not in the basket. Try keeping it.':'Check your basket: that exact feed + ID pair is already there. Try leaving it.';return;}answered=true;if(isNew){seen.set(key,x);const li=document.createElement('li');li.textContent=x.t;const code=document.createElement('code');code.textContent=names[x.f]+' · '+x.id;li.append(code);$('basket').append(li);$('count').textContent=seen.size;$('empty').hidden=true;} $('feedback').className='feedback good';$('feedback').textContent=x.why||(isNew?'A first-time arrival. One more good leaf in the basket.':'An item you have already seen. No duplicate needed.');$('choices').hidden=true;$('next').hidden=false;$('next').textContent=pos===queue.length-1?'Finish the harvest →':'Next signal →';$('next').focus();}
$('start').onclick=start;$('keep').onclick=()=>decide(true);$('repeat').onclick=()=>decide(false);
$('next').onclick=()=>{pos++;if(pos<queue.length){show();$('keep').focus();}else{$('game').hidden=true;$('finish').hidden=false;$('finishTitle').textContent=seen.size+' stories. Zero repeats.';$('orchard').dataset.grown='true';$('again').focus();}};
$('again').onclick=()=>{$('finish').hidden=true;$('welcome').hidden=false;$('start').disabled=false;document.querySelectorAll('.branch input').forEach(x=>x.disabled=false);$('setupnote').textContent='Choose a new mix of branches, or gather them all again.';$('start').focus();};
</script></body></html>
